'''Li'l Gau''' (ガウガウ gaugau, '''Gaugau''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. It has higher stats compared to its previous form as well as a bigger size. It was added in [[Version 1.4 Update|Version 1.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Li'l Gau
|image = E 029.png
|appearance = [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,200¢ - 4,740¢
}}

==Enemy==
Contrary to its previous form, this Li'l Gau can actually pose a threat: it has increased health, attack power and range and can become a very good tank for powerful backliners like [[Kerihime (form 2) (Enemy)|Princess Punt]].

==Strategy==
Even though it has a range increase it is so minimal to a point [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can attack it without the fear of clipping into its range, other high melee attackers can also be powerful like [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale]]. As for ubers units with high DPS are perfect counters like [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Balrog]] or [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Yukimura]].

